{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2440, the secret laboratory of &quot;Genesis Genes&quot; conducted a virus-nuclear energy fusion experiment to create super bio-weapons. The experiment went out of control, triggering global nuclear contamination and a massive genetic mutation event. From that day forward, Earth became uninhabitable for humans.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Third-person shooter game featuring weapon purchase, collection, and combination of four elemental bullets with unique capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028310/extras/6b2cc443d91566a94a9964beaef73350.avif?t=1758135302\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Each map exploration resets level and skill progression. During each expedition, defeat enemies to level up and select one of three random skills to stack at each upgrade, making combat progressively easier;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028310/extras/d62a112fd2c01f34a620c6d54ef25eca.poster.avif?t=1758135302\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028310/extras/d62a112fd2c01f34a620c6d54ef25eca.webm?t=1758135302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028310/extras/d62a112fd2c01f34a620c6d54ef25eca.mp4?t=1758135302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028310?t=1758135302","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028310/aa95ba6d2296a1aac95ff7cdef5c99db72e3ce4c/pa